# EAS Build upload exclusions.
#
# EAS CLI archives the whole git repo (this file's directory) as the build
# tarball. None of the paths below are needed to build the mobile app:
# brand tokens are generated into mobile/src/config/brand.ts and committed,
# and edge functions deploy separately via the Supabase CLI.
#
# Repo-content patterns are root-anchored (leading /) on purpose — an
# unanchored `scripts/` would also strip mobile/scripts out of the upload.
#
# CAUTION: when a .easignore exists, EAS CLI uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore
# to decide what to archive (docs.expo.dev/build-reference/easignore), so the
# security-relevant .gitignore entries are mirrored below. If you add a
# sensitive path to .gitignore, mirror it here.

# --- repo content not needed to build the mobile app ---
/web
/docs
/agent_docs
/db
/brand
/supabase
/scripts
/.github
/.claude
/.cursor
/.superpowers
/App Plans
/generated_imgs
/WAITLIST_AUDIT.md
/Blog post ideas.md
/WRITING_GUIDE.md

# --- mirrored from .gitignore: secrets + local state (must never upload) ---
.env*
*.pem
/.worktrees
node_modules/
.DS_Store
.vercel
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
mobile/mobile@*
chem-irl@*
